# BK-0010 test ROM (МСТД), K1801РЕ1-019, 160000-177577: the test monitor,
# reached by T in the monitor or P T in FOCAL.
#
# From the commented disassembly of this ROM by Dale corporation (Bryansk
# BK-0010 users' club, 1993-98), 019.zip from
# https://gid.pdp-11.net/sources.html (given to gid by Wesha). Its names
# and its descriptions, translated (its remarks on the code's style left
# out); checked against this ROM: 1904 of its 1927 instructions are here at
# the addresses it gives, the rest are slips in its text. It calls two
# routines TEST4 and two RUNTST; they are TEST3 and RUNTS3 here.

code 160000 STARTT
head 160000 System start: the monitor's T command and FOCAL's P T come here. Enter's
head 160000 code set to 12, the stack moved to 1000, vectors 4, 10 and 24 taken
head 160000 over.

code 160100 ENTERT

code 160102 CONT1
head 160102 Continue the start (from FOCAL's P T and the monitor's T).

code 160142 STWORK
head 160142 Interactive work starts here; most commands come back here.

code 160174 SET_TS
head 160174 Switch to the $ТС mode.

code 160212 SET_TD
head 160212 Switch to the #ТД mode (registers of the СКБК test stand).

code 160250 SET_TK
head 160250 Switch to the +ТК mode.

code 160306 MONTK
head 160306 The +ТК mode's command loop.

code 160336 CONT2

code 160362 CONT3

code 160404 NXTDIG

code 160414 CONT4

code 160426 SYMB2

code 160450 MONTS
